<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets China Merchant Hai Hong warrants.</title>
<headline>SGA sets China Merchant Hai Hong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV (SGA) said on Tuesday it has issued 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.87	PREMIUM	 23.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.29	GEARING	 3.02X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  12.FEB.98    EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> SPOT		  HK$8.75</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR STOCK DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
